---
import { faqPageSchema } from "../../lib/schema";

const questions = [
  {
    question: "How much does custom software development cost in Dubai?",
    answer:
      "Custom software does not require a large enterprise budget. A focused web application can start around AED 10,000, while a native mobile app or multi-module platform will cost more. We build to fit your stage and your scope, and we never quote you for features your business doesn’t need.",
  },
  {
    question: "How long does it take to build custom software?",
    answer:
      "Most custom software projects take at least 4 weeks. A focused internal tool takes 4 to 5 weeks; a multi-module business platform takes 6 to 10 weeks.",
  },
  {
    question: "Do you design and build websites for Dubai businesses?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Vedha designs and develops corporate websites, ecommerce stores, product sites and multilingual digital experiences for UAE businesses. Every website is designed around your brand, customer journey, local search visibility and the systems it needs to connect with, from CRM and payments to booking or enquiry flows.",
  },
  {
    question: "Do you build software that complies with UAE data protection law?",
    answer:
      "Yes. We design with the UAE Personal Data Protection Law (PDPL) in mind: data minimisation, access controls, encryption at rest and in transit and audit logging. Where data residency is required, we deploy to UAE-region cloud infrastructure.",
  },
  {
    question: "What happens if we know the problem but not the solution?",
    answer:
      "That is where many of our projects begin. Vedha’s digital transformation consulting helps you map the opportunity, review current systems, weigh build versus buy options, and define the right next step before committing to a full software build.",
  },
  {
    question: "How do I choose a software development company in Dubai?",
    answer:
      "Look for a team that combines senior engineering with strategic thinking, offers clear scoping and pricing, and stays close through delivery. Vedha works as a software development company in Dubai for SMEs and growing enterprises: fixed-price options available, no offshore handoffs, full transparency on timeline and scope.",
  },
];
const schema = faqPageSchema(questions);
---

<!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <figure class="scene-banner" data-scene-banner>
    <picture>
      <img
        src="/images/photo-mountain-mist.jpg"
        alt=""
        width="1600"
        height="1067"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </picture>
    <h2 class="scene-banner__title">FAQ</h2>
    <figcaption class="scene-banner__meta">
      <span>Answers</span>
      <span>Straight talk · No fluff</span>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="faq__list">
    {questions.map((item, i) => (
      <details class="faq__item" data-reveal>
        <summary>
          <span>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          {item.question}
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </summary>
        <p>{item.answer}</p>
      </details>
    ))}
  </div>
  <aside class="faq__more" data-reveal>
    <figure class="faq__more-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/images/photo-waterfall.jpg" alt="" width="720" height="436" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </figure>
    <div class="faq__more-copy">
      <p class="kicker">(Looking for more?)</p>
      <h4>Is your tech stack holding you back?</h4>
      <p class="faq__more-text">
        Bring us the bottleneck, the business goal or the idea in your notebook. We’ll help you build what comes next.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--dark" href="/#book" data-book-consultation><span>Book a free 30-minute consultation</span></a>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
</section>
